// WS-7 T13 — the model artifact directory holds BYTES ONLY, and they are never
// tracked.
//
// The 35 MB `needle3.cact` is a downloaded third-party artifact, not source.
// `.gitignore` (root) is outside this task's file-touch whitelist (spec :73),
// so the exclusion is expressed in a `.gitignore` INSIDE the directory it
// governs — which git honours, and which needs no amendment.
//
// `!README.md` and `!.gitignore` are re-included so the directory survives a
// clone with its instructions intact. Everything else in here is ignored.

# The verified artifact. Present locally and in CI (fetched by the gate), never
# committed. D15 requires it be SHA-256 pinned; modelManifest.mjs carries the pin.
needle3.cact
needle3.safetensors

# Any other artifact is equally untracked: the model directory is a download
# target, not a source directory. The digest gate is what admits a file here.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
